text = "				Dear Ratthew, 

		we wish thee luck opon thy journey into the hallowed grounds, 
	that cave from whence the trader hailed, who brought us the magnificent scriptures. 
		It is thy mission to prove the truth that they have brought, 
			the one that we have always known -
	That our Lord and Saviour is of our kind, and that he died for our sins as well...

		Now go forth, you Saint to be, and make our Family proud!




